## Spark Image Lab

Mac Image Lab is inspired by the operator workflow and local-first design of **Spark Image Lab** by Joey Rodriguez:

- Repository: <https://github.com/joeynyc/spark-image-lab>
- Copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Joey Rodriguez
- License: MIT

Spark Image Lab targets NVIDIA DGX Spark with a CUDA/Docker/Gradio stack. Mac Image Lab is an independent implementation for macOS, Apple Silicon, and a local ComfyUI/MPS backend. It neither bundles Spark Image Lab code nor Qwen model weights.

